# Vocali — cross-device sync (optional).
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your own values.
# `.env.local` is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# The app works fully WITHOUT these: it stores your practice log on the device.
# Add them to share one history between the desktop and the iPad.
#
# Get both values from your Supabase project: Settings → API.
# The anon key is public by design (it ships in the bundle); privacy comes from
# your passphrase, which derives an unguessable record id and never leaves the device.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
